      "content": "but you dont get it. it wasnt just a job. it was everything. i built that entire life from nothing, and now it's just... evaporated. there's no \"resilience\" when there's nothing left to fight for. it's not a storm, it's just the end. i'm just tired of pretending there's a way back from this.",
